  "description": "Reid Impact | 24 inch kids' mountain bike\nBuilt for young adventurers aged 8–11, the Reid Impact 24\" Kids' Mountain Bike is designed to make exploring more fun. With a durable steel frame, 7-speed Shimano gearing and reliable V brakes, it's a versatile choice for young riders ready to take on more varied terrain.\nThe 7-speed Shimano drivetrain gives riders a range of gears for tackling hills, neighbourhood streets and park paths, while powerful V brakes provide reliable stopping power and control. The durable steel frame is built for everyday riding and outdoor adventures.\nWhether they're cruising around the neighbourhood, exploring local parks or heading out on family rides, the Impact 24\" is ready to give young riders the freedom to explore and build confidence on two wheels.\nWho is the Impact 24 for?\nThe Reid Impact 24\" Kids' Mountain Bike is ideal for:\n\nYoung riders aged 8–11 ready for a 24\" mountain bike\nRiders developing confidence across different types of terrain\nChildren looking for the versatility of 7-speed gearing\nKids exploring neighbourhoods, parks and local trails\nParents looking for an affordable and durable kids' MTB\nEveryday adventures and family bike rides\n\nFind the right fit\nChoosing the right bike size helps young riders ride comfortably, confidently and safely. The Reid Impact 24\" is designed for riders aged 8–11. Use our Kids' Bike Size Guide by clicking the tab above to find the right Reid bike based on your child's height and age.",
